hotspot-share (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added Progressive Web App (PWA) offline shell and service worker caching.
  * Added mDNS and UDP broadcast peer auto-discovery engine.
  * Added ephemeral self-signed TLS/HTTPS encryption with --ssl flag.
  * Added smart batch conflict resolution engine with auto-renaming.
  * Fixed WebKitGTK blank QR canvas rendering bug.
  * Updated AppStream metadata with high-resolution screenshots and search SEO.

